  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag74" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;1. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;2. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;3. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;4. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;5. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;6. Not applicable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;7. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;8.&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;"&gt;The wage rate for Hampshire's non-management employees reflected a 3.0% increase, effective January 1, 2026. There was no such change for management employees.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;9. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;10. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;11. None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;12. On January 15, 2026, the following officers were added: Mark Reed, VP Supply Chain, Megan Roberts-Satinsky, VP Legal, and Janet Burrows, Treasurer. On Jan 7, 2026, Colin Bond replaced Wendy Zelond as a Director. Wendy Zelond also ceased as an officer on January 7, 2026.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;13. Not applicable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
